        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90">右上角標</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-theme-sm leading-6 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">適合標記新品、推薦或版本更新。角標不影響內容排版。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 md:p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/[0.03]">
