        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90">斜角促銷標</h3>
        <div class="mt-3 aspect-[3/1] rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-100 to-amber-50 dark:from-red-500/20 dark:to-amber-500/10"></div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-theme-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">雙十一限時直降 40%</p>
    </section>

    <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/[0.03]">
